# Item 5 of #928: a switch that takes `swarm` out of `agy -p /skills`.
# Windows 11 Pro 10.0.26300, agy 1.5.8 (<localappdata>\agy\bin\agy.exe), 2026-11-13.
# Every call: agy --gemini_dir=<R> ..., <R> a new temp folder per root (signed in through
# Credential Manager). /skills calls ran with MSYS_NO_PATHCONV=1 and --print-timeout 60s.
# cwd: <repo> is C:\Dev\ralphy (has .agents/skills with three project skills); <cwd> is an
# empty temp folder. `/skills` output is cut to the first column (the skill names).

